1868 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Elimination in SAT solvers like Lingeling is a preprocessing step where certain variables or clauses are removed or simplified before the main solving begins. The elim parameter determines the extent of this elimination process, allowing the solver to decide which variables or clauses should be removed or ignored to reduce the complexity of the problem.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1869 0 obj
