/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Eliminating Redundant Variables: By removing variables that do not contribute significantly to the solution, the solver can focus on the most important parts of the formula, potentially reducing the solving time.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1871 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Simplification: The elim parameter helps to simplify the problem by eliminating variables or clauses that would otherwise make the problem more complex to solve, leading to faster solutions.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1872 0 obj
